<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?><?xml-stylesheet href="http://www.blogger.com/styles/atom.css" type="text/css"?><feed xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom' xmlns:openSearch='http://a9.com/-/spec/opensearchrss/1.0/' xmlns:gd="http://schemas.google.com/g/2005"><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post3819934798679441949..comments</id><updated>2017-04-13T04:47:21.148-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Comments on Pro Libertate: Briefly Considered: A Prediction Partially Fulfilled</title><link rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#feed' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/feeds/comments/default'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html'/><link rel="hub" href="http://pubsubhubbub.appspot.com/"/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='19' src='http://3.bp.blogspot.com/-5rhFUXs_62I/VgVL2E3rMII/AAAAAAAAMJ4/cjJOyI7W208/s220/Photo%2BRon%2BPaul%2BLiberty%2BReport.jpg'/></author><generator version='7.00' uri='http://www.blogger.com'>Blogger</generator><openSearch:totalResults>16</openSearch:totalResults><openSearch:startIndex>1</openSearch:startIndex><openSearch:itemsPerPage>25</openSearch:itemsPerPage><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5396555846353753582</id><published>2012-01-17T13:18:06.215-07:00</published><updated>2012-01-17T13:18:06.215-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Yes your wife has been and will continue to be in ...</title><content type='html'>Yes your wife has been and will continue to be in my prayers.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/5396555846353753582'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/5396555846353753582'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html?showComment=1326831486215#c5396555846353753582' title=''/><author><name>RossHeckmann</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01177361650896189984</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3819934798679441949' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3819934798679441949' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1853628699"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="January 17, 2012 at 1:18 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1698711589386173213</id><published>2007-10-31T15:53:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-10-31T15:53:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I really think Romney could win EVERYBODY over wit...</title><content type='html'>I really think Romney could win EVERYBODY over with the following speech on religion:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;http://christianprophecy.blogspot.com/2007/10/mitt-romneys-speech-on-religion.html</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/1698711589386173213'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/1698711589386173213'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html?showComment=1193867580000#c1698711589386173213' title=''/><author><name>A Christian Prophet</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/10020964652943679070</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='28' height='32' src='http://www.geocities.com/holy_instant/pentecost.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3819934798679441949' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3819934798679441949' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-115145860"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 31, 2007 at 3:53 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-520669279960992696</id><published>2007-10-23T11:12:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-10-23T11:12:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Your steadfast faith and devotion to all your beli...</title><content type='html'>Your steadfast faith and devotion to all your beliefs, moral and spiritual, has touched my jaded heart in a fashion I thought not possible.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I will pray for you and your family, and perhaps borrow a little of your faith, in hopes that even the prayers of a different faith, offered in unity and good cause, shall lift up and bless your wife and family in this troubling time.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;-R</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/520669279960992696'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/520669279960992696'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html?showComment=1193159520000#c520669279960992696' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3819934798679441949' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3819934798679441949' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 23, 2007 at 11:12 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1585481512990793158</id><published>2007-10-18T11:36:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-10-18T11:36:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>As a graduate of BJU I was seriously disappointed ...</title><content type='html'>As a graduate of BJU I was seriously disappointed by this announcement. I spent 4 great years there in the 80&#39;s and found it a wonderful environment. The broader Christian community seems to be entirely misled by Limbaugh, Farah, et al.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Blessings to you and your beloved.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Jim O&#39;Connor</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/1585481512990793158'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/1585481512990793158'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html?showComment=1192728960000#c1585481512990793158' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3819934798679441949' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3819934798679441949' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 18, 2007 at 11:36 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3261048164412068182</id><published>2007-10-18T00:34:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-10-18T00:34:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>This Catholic would like to add his prayers (and a...</title><content type='html'>This Catholic would like to add his prayers (and a fast) for your wife, Mr. Girgg, if there are no objections...  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Korrin, sister in Christ: May our Lord Jesus go before you that He may defend you; within you that He may sustain you; alongside you that He may lead you; behind you that He may protect you; and about you that He may bless you, now and always--He who lives and reigns with the Father and the Holy Spirit, for ever and ever, amen.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/3261048164412068182'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/3261048164412068182'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html?showComment=1192689240000#c3261048164412068182' title=''/><author><name>Jon</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3819934798679441949' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3819934798679441949' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 18, 2007 at 12:34 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8257388660451916953</id><published>2007-10-17T23:33:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-10-17T23:33:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>&quot;But the grim, unyielding reality is that Dr. Paul...</title><content type='html'>&quot;But the grim, unyielding reality is that Dr. Paul -- a man who is Christian to his chromosomes, and loves freedom with every molecule of his being -- is disqualified in the eyes of Jones and his ilk for theological reasons: The God Ron Paul serves is Jesus Christ, Prince of Peace and Sovereign Lord of all creation, not the supposedly almighty State.&quot;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;So well said!  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;A few years ago, we kept hoping that most of our fellow Christians would get their heads out of the clouds and join in the freedom fight.  But after 9/11 revealed their true colors, it appears that we may have been better off when they were just plain disinterested and uninvolved.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;We surely did hate to hear about Korrin&#39;s setback and pray that her health will soon be restored.  We also pray for an extra measure of comfort and strength to be poured out upon you and your family.  May God bless and keep all of you.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/8257388660451916953'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/8257388660451916953'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html?showComment=1192685580000#c8257388660451916953' title=''/><author><name>Ex-JBS</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13022405014549557830</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3819934798679441949' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3819934798679441949' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1718797360"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 17, 2007 at 11:33 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4509563668091519641</id><published>2007-10-17T22:45:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-10-17T22:45:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Yahweh Elohim has both Korrin and you in the palms...</title><content type='html'>Yahweh Elohim has both Korrin and you in the palms of his almighty and eternal hands. My prayers are with Korrin and I will continue to keep her in my prayers. &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;In Yahshuah The Only saviors name,&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Amen and Amen brother!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/4509563668091519641'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/4509563668091519641'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html?showComment=1192682700000#c4509563668091519641' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3819934798679441949' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3819934798679441949' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 17, 2007 at 10:45 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4078629854539234352</id><published>2007-10-17T21:16:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-10-17T21:16:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will,My heartfelt prayers are with you and your de...</title><content type='html'>Will,&lt;BR/&gt;My heartfelt prayers are with you and your dear Korrin. &lt;BR/&gt;Allen</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/4078629854539234352'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/4078629854539234352'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html?showComment=1192677360000#c4078629854539234352' title=''/><author><name>Allen</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/01371636085171917630</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://www.geocities.com/rab_fw/ab.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3819934798679441949' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3819934798679441949' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1286482029"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 17, 2007 at 9:16 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6483848231392542872</id><published>2007-10-17T11:37:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-10-17T11:37:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will,    We here at Trinity Bible Fellowship will ...</title><content type='html'>Will,&lt;BR/&gt;    We here at Trinity Bible Fellowship will continue our prayer vigil for Korrin. This includes Dr. Phil Fernandes and his wife Cathy, Greg and Linda Carey, Gary and Pam Tronson, and so many others of our church and former members who live throughout the US. We pray and ask that Y&#39;shua the Messiah will heal her. May it be His will.&lt;BR/&gt;Amen.&lt;BR/&gt;                -R. Wiesinger</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/6483848231392542872'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/6483848231392542872'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html?showComment=1192642620000#c6483848231392542872' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3819934798679441949' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3819934798679441949' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 17, 2007 at 11:37 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-7915422243412831931</id><published>2007-10-17T11:30:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-10-17T11:30:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I will certainly pray for Korrin, Will. Your perse...</title><content type='html'>I will certainly pray for Korrin, Will. Your perseverance and tenacity in the face of such a trial is amazing.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I agree with anonymous that the Psalms, the entire book, is a sustaining manna always, but especially in times of extreme trial.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/7915422243412831931'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/7915422243412831931'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html?showComment=1192642200000#c7915422243412831931' title=''/><author><name>dixiedog</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09845646940134894119</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='32' src='http://members.cox.net/ogdenwb/images/dixiedog1.jpg'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3819934798679441949' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3819934798679441949' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-504942784"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 17, 2007 at 11:30 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4406468987120392599</id><published>2007-10-17T10:02:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-10-17T10:02:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will, Your demeanor under fire is truly an inspira...</title><content type='html'>Will, Your demeanor under fire is truly an inspiration and example.  Keep up the good fight. Be strong and of good courage.  He is able and faithful, as you have testified.  And we will go to the Father for you and Korrin.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/4406468987120392599'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/4406468987120392599'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html?showComment=1192636920000#c4406468987120392599' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3819934798679441949' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3819934798679441949' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 17, 2007 at 10:02 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-2588861471929279929</id><published>2007-10-17T09:55:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-10-17T09:55:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will:Hang in there!  Everyone&#39;s thoughts and praye...</title><content type='html'>Will:&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Hang in there!  Everyone&#39;s thoughts and prayers are with you and Korrin.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/2588861471929279929'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/2588861471929279929'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html?showComment=1192636500000#c2588861471929279929' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3819934798679441949' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3819934798679441949' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-529179912"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 17, 2007 at 9:55 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-9042972394971149450</id><published>2007-10-17T05:48:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-10-17T05:48:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>I&#39;m not smart enough to say anything more than I&#39;m...</title><content type='html'>I&#39;m not smart enough to say anything more than I&#39;m standing with you, Will</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/9042972394971149450'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/9042972394971149450'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html?showComment=1192621680000#c9042972394971149450' title=''/><author><name>Broken</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12866635425857133740</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3819934798679441949' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3819934798679441949' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-562933124"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 17, 2007 at 5:48 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-8105078228272739122</id><published>2007-10-16T23:29:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-10-16T23:29:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Will;You, your lovely wife and family are in my pr...</title><content type='html'>Will;&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;You, your lovely wife and family are in my prayers.  I lost my wife 3 years ago after she battled heart disease for 2 years.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;I know that your faith in Jesus will see you and Korrin through this.  It has been my experience that sometimes we are tested to the point that we feel we can&#39;t bear it any longer, but somehow, through God&#39;s grace we make it.  &lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;That is my prayer for you and your family.  It ain&#39;t much, but it comes from the heart.&lt;BR/&gt;&lt;BR/&gt;Keep up the great writing, I look forward to your thoughts, and those of the commenters, as I visit here as often as I can.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/8105078228272739122'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/8105078228272739122'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html?showComment=1192598940000#c8105078228272739122' title=''/><author><name>negatore</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-3819934798679441949' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/3819934798679441949' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-262634513"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="October 16, 2007 at 11:29 PM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-5871073606605123195</id><published>2007-10-16T20:07:00.000-06:00</published><updated>2007-10-16T20:07:00.000-06:00</updated><title type='text'>Dear JEA -- You have literally brought tears to my...</title><content type='html'>Dear JEA -- You have literally brought tears to my eyes with your kindness. Thank you, and G-d bless you as well.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/5871073606605123195'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/3819934798679441949/comments/default/5871073606605123195'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2007/10/very-briefly-considered-prediction.html?showComment=1192586820000#c5871073606605123195' title=''/><author><name>William N. Grigg</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/14368220509514750246</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd: